#: main.cpp:24
msgid "KDE Crash Handler give the user feedback if a program crashed."
msgstr ""
"Lo manegador de petades KDE dóna l'informacion de l'usuari si a petat un "
"programo."

#: main.cpp:28
msgid "The signal number we caught."
msgstr "Lo número de senhal que em capturat."

#: main.cpp:29
msgid "Name of the program."
msgstr "Nomi del programo."

#: main.cpp:30
msgid "The version of the program."
msgstr "La version del programo."

#: main.cpp:31
msgid "The bug address to use."
msgstr "L'adreça d'error a usar."

#: main.cpp:32
msgid "Translated name of the program."
msgstr "Nomi traduich del programo."

#: main.cpp:33
msgid "The PID of the program"
msgstr "Lo PID del programo"

#: main.cpp:34
msgid "The program was started by kdeinit"
msgstr "Lo programo a essat engegat per kdeinit"

#: main.cpp:44
msgid "The KDE Crash Handler"
msgstr "Lo manegador de petades del KDE"

#: toplevel.cpp:35
msgid "&Bug report"
msgstr "Informe d'&error"

#: toplevel.cpp:36
msgid "&Debugger"
msgstr "&Depurador"

#: toplevel.cpp:40
msgid "General"
msgstr "General"

#: toplevel.cpp:53
msgid "Backtrace"
msgstr "Traça enrera"

#: toplevel.cpp:72
msgid "<p><b>Short description</b></p><p>%1</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>Descripcion corta</b></p><p>%1</p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:76
msgid "<p><b>What is this?</b></p><p>%1</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>Què és acò?</b></p><p>%1</p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:80
msgid "<p><b>What can I do?</b></p><p>%1</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>Què pòdi har|far?</b></p><p>%1</p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:85
msgid "<p><b>Application crashed</b></p><p>The program %appname crashed.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>L'aplicacion a petat</b></p><p>Lo programo %appname a petat.</p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:103
msgid ""
"<p>Do you want to generate a backtrace? This will help the developers to "
"figure out what went wrong.</p>\n"
"<p>Unfortunately this will take some time on slow machines.</p><p><b>Note: A "
"backtrace is not a substitute for a proper description the bug and "
"information on how to reproduce it. It is not possible to fix the bug "
"without a proper description.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Voletz generar una traça enrera? Acò ajudarà alos desvelopadors a "
"descobrir çò què a anat malament.</p>\n"
"<p>Desafortunadament acò durarà ua mica de temps en màquines "
"lentes.</p><p><b>Nota: Una traça inversa no és un substitut d'una bona "
"descripcion de l'error e informacion de com reproduir-lo. No és possible "
"corregir l'error sense una bona descripcion.</b></p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:115
msgid "Include Backtrace"
msgstr "Inclou la traça enrera"

#: toplevel.cpp:175
msgid "It was not possible to generate a backtrace."
msgstr "No a estat possible generar una traça enrera."

#: toplevel.cpp:176
msgid "Backtrace not possible"
msgstr "No és possible far|har traça enrera"

#: debugger.cpp:44
msgid "Done."
msgstr "Fet|Heit."

#: debugger.cpp:49
msgid "Unable to create backtrace."
msgstr "Podi pas crear la traça enrera."

#: debugger.cpp:54
msgid "Loading backtrace..."
msgstr "S'essei carregant la traça enrera..."

#: debugger.cpp:71
msgid "Loading symbols..."
msgstr "S'essan carregant los símbols..."

#: krashconf.cpp:40
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "esconut"

#: drbugreport.cpp:34
msgid ""
"You have to edit the description\n"
"before the report can be sent."
msgstr ""
"Que cau  editar la descripcion\n"
"abans de poder enviar l'informe."





